('Yacht tour','baku','Entry Ticket : 1 hr (6 pax), Boat Type - Mini Kater','- By sailing experience on the Caspian Sea guests can enjoy panoramic views of the city skyline, the Seaside Boulevard, and the surrounding coastal landscapes. The tour starts from the Seaside Boulevard, a national park, and sails all the way to the shores of Great Zira Island.  Note: Catering food & drinking alcohol is allowed. Yacht can accommodates 6 people for a 1-hour trip. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,30,30,NULL),
