('Funicular Ride at Highland Park','baku','Entry Ticket: 1 Way','- Either up to Highland Park or down to the city center, giving passengers breathtaking views of Baku and the Caspian Sea along the way. The funicular was first constructed in the 1960s as part of Baku’s urban development, making it both a practical transport link and a tourist attraction. The ride takes you past the lush greenery of the park and provides access to landmarks like Martyrs’ Alley, the Eternal Flame, and panoramic viewpoints over the city.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
('Funicular Ride at Highland Park','baku','Entry Ticket: 2 Way','- The round-trip ticket allows visitors to travel both up and down Highland Park, providing a complete scenic experience. This historic funicular has become an iconic symbol of Baku, blending mid-20th-century engineering with stunning views of the Caspian coastline. Along the journey, passengers can admire the city’s skyline, waterfront, and the park’s landscaped gardens, making it a popular choice for both locals and tourists.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,2,NULL),
('Caspian Cruise','baku','Entry Ticket: Standard Seat - 20 Mins','- Caspian Cruise trip offers a scenic journey along Baku’s coastline, providing views of the city’s blend of historic architecture and modern skyline. Passengers can see landmarks such as the Baku Boulevard, the Flame Towers, and historic port areas, all while enjoying the fresh sea breeze. The cruise celebrates Baku’s long-standing connection to the Caspian Sea, which has been central to the city’s trade, culture, and maritime history for centuries.  Note: This activity operates subject to weather conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,6,NULL),
('Caspian Cruise','baku','Entry Ticket: VIP Seat - 20 Mins','- VIP Caspian cruise seat provides an elevated experience with premium seating, ensuring unobstructed panoramic views of Baku’s waterfront and cityscape. In addition to the sights of Baku Boulevard and the Flame Towers, the VIP option allows visitors to fully relax while enjoying the historical context of Baku as a key Caspian port. The Caspian Cruise offers a combination of sightseeing, leisure, and appreciation of the city’s maritime heritage in a more luxurious setting.  Note: This activity operates subject to weather conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9,9,NULL),
