('Baliqli Lake Picnic Package','baku','All Inclusive - Minimum 4 Pax','Included: - Transportation - Entrance - Coal - Fuel - Tea & Barbecue Equipment - Indoor & Outdoor Sitting Area - Max. for 4 / 6 / 8/ 10 person.   Note: Food and drinks rates are not included, this will be depend on guest choice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,14,14,NULL),
('Aquapark','baku','Entry Ticket','Guests can enjoy the following facilities and attractions:  - Locker - Towel - Restrooms - Changing rooms - Lifeguard assistance - Tube slides - Main swimming pool access - Water playground zone for kids  Note: Food and beverages are not included and are available at an additional cost.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,30,30,NULL),
('Swimming Pool','baku','Entry Ticket','Included:  - Locker - Towel - Restrooms - Changing rooms - Lifeguard assistance - Main swimming pool access - Pool for kids  Note: Food and beverages are not included and are available at an additional cost.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,20,20,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Slide Baku (Denizmall)','- Experience the famous multi-level glass slide inside Deniz Mall, offering a fun and exciting ride with stunning indoor views.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Softplay Area (Denizmall)','- A safe and colorful play zone for young children, filled with soft structures, worry-free fun for 1 hour. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,20,20,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Skypark Rooftop (Denizmall)','- Sky Park is one of the main entertainment zones inside Deniz Mall — located on the 5th floor. It’s designed as a fun and modern amusement area, offering a variety of attractions for both kids and adults. The concept promises excitement — “lifting your feet off the ground and raising you to the tops,” hinting at dynamic, high energy entertainment. For families: a safe, indoor entertainment zone where kids and adults can enjoy together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,25,25,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','VR Glasses (Denizmall)','- Strap on the VR headset and feel the excitement of a high-speed car race — a fully immersive virtual reality experience!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,22,22,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Train Excursion (Baku Boulevard)','- Children can hop aboard a charming mini-train and enjoy a scenic excursion along the famous Baku Boulevard, taking in the sights of the Caspian Sea and the city’s waterfront.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Scary Home (Baku Boulevard)','- Scary Home is a horror-themed attraction designed to give visitors a thrilling and spooky experience. Guests walk through dark, themed rooms filled with sound effects, special lighting, and surprise scares, making it a fun stop for those who enjoy adrenaline-filled activities along Baku Boulevard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,14,14,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Bumper Cars ride (Baku Boulevard)','- The Bumper Cars ride is a lively and entertaining attraction where guests can drive small electric cars around a dedicated arena and gently bump into one another in a safe and controlled environment. With upbeat music and colorful lights, it creates a cheerful atmosphere that appeals to both children and adults. It’s a great activity for families and friends to enjoy some light-hearted fun while taking a break during their walk along Baku Boulevard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Ice Rink','- The Ice Rink offers a refreshing and enjoyable experience where visitors can skate on a well-maintained ice surface, regardless of the season. It is suitable for both beginners and experienced skaters, with skate rentals available on site. The cool atmosphere, music, and lively setting make it a fun activity for families, couples, and friends looking to enjoy something active and different.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
('Kids'' Activities','baku','Color Lab Art Space','- Color Lab Art Space is an interactive and creative attraction where visitors can explore rooms filled with vibrant colors, lights, and artistic installations. It offers a fun, immersive experience that encourages creativity and is perfect for taking unique photos and videos. This space is especially popular with art lovers and anyone looking for a modern, visually engaging activity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
('Fire temple - Ateshgah','baku','Entry Ticket','- The Fire Temple (Ateshgah) near Baku, built in the 17th century on ancient Zoroastrian fire-worship sites, features a pentagonal structure with a central altar, monk cells, and inscriptions.  Note: This is an open-air complex; comfortable footwear is recommended due to rocky terrain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9,9,NULL),
('Burning Mountains - Yanardag','baku','Entry Ticket','- Burning Mountains (Yanar Dag) display continuously burning natural gas flames. Yanar Dag has been officially burning since the 1950s, though natural gas fires in Absheron were known and revered since ancient times.  Note: This is an open-air complex; comfortable footwear is recommended due to rocky terrain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9,9,NULL),
